<title>USA: Substance Abuse to get U.S. Drug shrs.</title>
<headline>Substance Abuse to get U.S. Drug shrs.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Substance Abuse Technologies Inc said it will receive stock in U.S. Drug Testing Inc in lieu of a $2.21 million loan repayment.</p>
<p>U.S. Drug is to issue 1,768,203 shares of common stock in lieu of the loan repayment.</p>
<p>Prior to the issuance, Substance Abuse owned about 67 percent of U.S. Drug's outstanding shares. It was not immediately known how many shares U.S. Drug has outstanding.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
